      "content": "I want CONDOR communities for my brain organoid study. The only file I want to give it is the raw gene-by-sample expression matrix; please feed that straight into CONDOR."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"I want CONDOR communities for my brain organoid study.\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set. CONDOR gives: communities in one bipartite network, with regulator-side and gene-side memberships, by bipartite modularity. Each regulator's and gene's core score -- its share of its community's modularity -- to pick out each community's core nodes.\n\nI couldn't match this to a result any registered NetZoo workflow produces, so none is offered.\n\nRegistered workflows that take the kind of data you described: PANDA, PUMA, LIONESS-PANDA, LIONESS-PUMA, LIONESS-COEXPRESSION, COBRA, DRAGON, LIONESS-DRAGON, OTTER, GIRAFFE, BONOBO. Tell me if one of them gives what you meant, or which result you need.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
